# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local git mein nahi jata.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Site ka asli domain — stand wala QR isi par point karta hai.
# Set na karo to QR https://nextbite.com.au par jayega.
# Trailing slash ki zaroorat nahi.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://nextbite.com.au

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ENQUIRY DELIVERY
#
# Form /api/enquiry par POST hota hai. Wahan se enquiry do
# jagah ja sakti hai:
#
#   1. DISK — hamesha. .data/enquiries/enquiries.jsonl mein
#      likhi jati hai, attachment .data/enquiries/files/ mein.
#      Yeh normal Node server (VPS, Docker, `next start`) par
#      theek hai.
#
#      ⚠ Vercel / Netlify jaisi serverless hosting par disk
#        har request ke baad khatam ho jati hai — wahan neeche
#        wala webhook ZAROOR set karo, warna enquiries kho
#        jayengi.
#
#   2. WEBHOOK — agar yeh set ho. Enquiry ka JSON is URL par
#      POST hota hai. Zapier / Make / n8n / Slack — jahan se
#      aap ise Travis ke inbox tak pohancha sakte ho.
#
# Dono nakaam hon to API 500 deta hai aur user ko email par
# raabta karne ko kehta hai — taake koi lead khamoshi se
# zaya na ho.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/xxxxx/yyyyy

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ENQUIRY FORM — NextBite .NET API
#
# Form isi pate par jata hai. Set na ho to Next.js ki apni
# /api/enquiry route chalti hai (sirf Node hosting par).
#
# Asal API do marhalon mein leti hai:
#   POST  /api/enquiries        → step 1 save, token wapas
#   PATCH /api/enquiries/{id}   → usi token ke saath tafseel
# Yeh do-marhala flow sirf tab chalta hai jab endpoint set ho.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://nextbiteapi.webappconsulting.com.au/api/enquiries

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOSTING KI ASAL SOORAT (26 Aug 2026)
#
#   nextbite-web.vercel.app  →  Vercel. Push par khud deploy hota
#                               hai. Node chalta hai, is liye
#                               /api/enquiry kaam karti hai.
#
#   nextbite.com.au          →  Firebase Hosting (199.36.158.100).
#                               Alag, purani static build. Push se
#                               is par kuch nahi jata.
#
# Yaani domain abhi Vercel par point NAHI karta. Jab tak DNS
# nahi badalta, nayi cheezein sirf vercel.app par nazar aayengi.
#
# ⚠ Vercel par filesystem read-only hai — disk sink hamesha nakaam
#   hoti hai. Is liye wahan ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL set karna ZAROORI
#   hai, warna har submit 500 deta hai (jaan boojh kar — taake lead
#   khamoshi se zaya na ho; payload server logs mein bhi jata hai).
#
# Static host par bhejna ho to yeh endpoint set karo — koi bhi
# jagah jo FormData qubool kare (Formspree, Web3Forms, Firebase
# Function, Zapier catch hook). Set na ho to /api/enquiry chalti hai.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
